    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_of_Intrigue\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You are adept at creating convincing disguises in remarkably short periods of time.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> 13</p><p><b>Effect:</b> You gain a +5 insight bonus to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> check when creating a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deceptive_Appearance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deceptive Appearance\">Deceptive Appearance</a>. In addition, you can rush the process by taking a -2 penalty to the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> check.</p><p><b>Normal:</b> When you rush the creation of a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deceptive_Appearance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deceptive Appearance\">Deceptive Appearance</a>, you take a -10 penalty to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> check.</p>",
